ROUTINE RLM2Audit
 ; Optional AI Hub deliverable: the same data-quality audit as ^RLMAudit, run by
 ; the delegating RLM (Gaia.RLM2) instead of the ObjectScript-driven one. Written
 ; to data/out/rlm2_audit.md so the two reports can be compared side by side.
 ;
 ; The difference is who owns the recursion. ^RLMAudit walks the slice tree in
 ; ObjectScript and asks the model only which dimension to split by; this one
 ; hands the model a slice grammar and a %AI.Agent.SubAgent it can delegate to,
 ; and lets it decide what to explore.
 ;
 ; Kept out of ^RunScript for the same reason as ^Analyze and ^RLMAudit: it makes
 ; LLM calls, so its wall-clock is not ours to control. Requires OPENAI_API_KEY;
 ; without it the report says so and result.csv is untouched.
 ;
 ; Run ^RunScript first - this reads GaiaQualityScored and its two materialized
 ; prediction columns, which that pipeline produces.
 New outDir,report
 Set outDir = "/home/irisowner/dev/data/out"
 Do ##class(%File).CreateDirectoryChain(outDir)
 Write "Running Gaia.RLM2 audit (delegating, <=",##class(Gaia.RLM2).#MAXCALLS," delegations)...",!
 Set report = ##class(Gaia.RLM2).Audit(outDir_"/rlm2_audit.md")
 Write "Audit: ",outDir,"/rlm2_audit.md (",$Length(report)," chars)",!
 Write "Delegations used: ",##class(Gaia.RLM2).Spent(),!
 Quit
